prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-regexpinitialize spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-parsepattern spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-patterns-static-semantics-early-errors spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-mightbothparticipate ref:regexpref@1
script: new RegExp("(?<\\u0061>x)(?<a>y)", "") instanceof RegExp
note: correspondence row S2a: the duplicate test compares CapturingGroupName, the decoded name; /: refused (early:duplicate-group-name)
since: 31

