note: correspondence row S4: AtomEscape, CharacterEscape and B.1.2's escapes; /: accepted; the outcome holds with B.1.2 alone (without Annex B: error: SyntaxError); Annex B is required of a web-browser host and optional for any other; both engines answer B.1.2's patterns (Broiler.VM's JSD-0081, requirement R5, Annex B syntax where the specification allows it, and bundle sjl-11-001's correspondence, rows S4 and S7, same in both), so each engine's expectation is B.1.2's outcome
since: 31

